  "title": "Vegetarian Thanksgiving Soup with Carrots, Ginger, and Coconut",
  "description": "Carrots, ginger, coconut, and herbs bring comforting flavor to this vegetarian soup that's perfect for Thanksgiving if you need a break from the traditional turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "Allrecipes Member"
  ],
